x":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1422696125:1":{"text":"そして、霊水がもたらす甘く爛れた夢に、変わらずすがろうとする者も大勢いるでしょう。","source_cn":"而且，肯定会有更多人，会继续沉迷于灵露带来的，温暖而甜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD79AEA2D630E5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1422696126:1":{"text":"……これに関しては、引き続き対処する必要がありますが――","source_cn":"……那就是我们仍然需要处理的工作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9FFA58F38621CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1422696127:0":{"text":"それ以外は、各々の選択に委ねるべきだと、私は思います。","source_cn":"但，除此之外的一切，我想，都应该是给予所有人的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C66D0C9C49A517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1422696128:0":{"text":"地上に行きたいなら行って、戻りたくなったら戻ればいい。どこにいたって、ちゃんと居場所はある……ってことかな？","source_cn":"想去地表去地表，想回地底回地底，无论在哪都有一席之地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860B3326C27DA9C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1422696129:1":{"text":"うん、素晴らしい答えだね。","source_cn":"真是非常不错的答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47F046BA8C33207B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":